    {
      "category": "faculty",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "The Faculty of Arts, Humanities and Social Sciences (AHSS) is a dynamic community where ideas are explored, challenged, and brought to life. It offers high-quality teaching and a rich research environment that spans traditional disciplines and innovative interdisciplinary work.",
